{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["לא תבערו אש — Because for festivals it is written: ״אשר יאכל לכל נפש הוא לבדו יעשה לכם״, and there kindling a fire is permitted for baking and cooking. But for Shabbat it is written: ״את אשר תאפו אפו מבעוד יום״, ״ואת אשר תבשלו בשלו״. Therefore it warns that on Shabbat: לא תבערו אש — for the labor of food preparation, and all the more so other labors, which are forbidden even on a festival."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:43:59.042957802Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}